.\" groff → PostScript → Ghostscript (ps2pdf), like many older Unix/TeX-era PDFs:
.\" Type 1 fonts converted to Type1C subsets with a custom encoding.
.ps 14
.vs 30
.ft R
India times roman text in ghostscript
.br
.ft B
Juliet bold text in ghostscript
.br
.ft H
Kilo helvetica text in ghostscript
.br
